{"id":"n60020-2-10","stage":5,"title":"부실 · 不实","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60020-2-10-1","ko":"멀쩡하던 아파트가 왜 갑자기 무너진 거야?","zh":"本来好好的公寓，为什么会突然倒塌呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"멀쩡하던","meaning":"好好儿的，好端端的","explanation":"멀쩡하다：好好儿的，好端端的；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"멀쩡하다","audio":"/audio/505a81d41085f8c8ee2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54972","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀쩡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀쩡하던","audio":"/audio/1d1ab37ce8583bcc82ef.mp3"}},{"text":"아파트가","meaning":"公寓","explanation":"아파트：公寓；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29610","senseId":"1","lemma":"아파트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파트가","audio":"/audio/c8795169c6e51e2510a2.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"무너진","meaning":"倒塌，坍塌","explanation":"무너지다：倒塌，坍塌；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무너지다","audio":"/audio/97dcdfb77be61ad9d19b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15517","senseId":"1","lemma":"무너지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무너진","audio":"/audio/997c1e5a0b4cff6d33f1.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7